36
00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:19.380
So that we keep going deeper and deeper into these levels of holiness.

37
00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:22.740
And if you get on further on in, you discover that there's a

38
00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:23.460
perfect

