69
00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:12.360
It's not that all of the Levites weren't holy. They were.

70
00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:16.810
It's just that deeper levels of holiness were needed and

71
00:04:16.899 --> 00:04:20.870
possible in connecting with God. It's not just that

72
00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:23.840
all of Aaron's descendants, all of Aaron's family, are not holy.

73
00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:27.680
It's just that deeper levels of holiness were needed and

74
00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:31.440
possible in connecting with God. Now, for just a moment,

75
00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:34.240
let's pause and bring that idea to our life.

76
00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:39.060
A common misunderstanding of holiness in today's world is to

77
00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.620
believe that it's one thing. It's like all or nothing.

78
00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.920
You get saved, you've got holiness, and you do. Praise God.

79
00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.219
And that's it.

80
00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:51.900
Now I've got it. Nothing more is needed. Nothing more is possible.

81
00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:56.300
And I would just caution you that it's not

82
00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:00.880
either you got it or you don't, all or nothing, because people tend to think of

83
00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:04.580
it as if there's no movement, there's no growth, that

84
00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:07.840
nothing more is needed or possible.

85
00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:12.720
And this has produced roadblocks to some people's spiritual growth.

86
00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:17.370
You see, if you don't think that anything more is needed or anything

87
00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:21.000
more is possible, then you stop looking for growth and

88
00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:24.820
opportunities to draw closer to the Lord and grow in your

89
00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.520
holiness. You level off in your enjoyment of God

90
00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:31.440
and your depth of your becoming like him.

91
00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:35.220
You don't stay serious about continued growth if you stop

92
00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.060
seeking and following holiness.

93
00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.140
I taught you a couple of days ago

94
00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:45.570
to relax into God's drawing of you into holiness,

95
00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:49.900
but relaxing into God's continued plan of making me holy is

96
00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:53.280
not the same thing as thinking I've already

97
00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:55.340
arrived, and I don't need anything more.

98
00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.600
That's a totally different thing.

99
00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:00.600
So here's what I want to say and teach you today.

100
00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.820
If you've just been saved, deeper levels of holiness are

101
00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.620
needed and possible.

102
00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:11.000
If you've been walking with the Lord for a while, guess what?

103
00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:14.990
Deeper levels of holiness are needed and

104
00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:18.940
possible. The deeper we go into holiness, the deeper we

105
00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:22.700
go into God's essential nature. And the deeper we go into God, the

106
00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.840
more joy and the more satisfaction we find there.

107
00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:30.820
The deeper we go into God's holiness, the more useful we are to

108
00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:33.420
him. And the deeper we go into God's holiness,

109
00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.780
the more glory he gets from our lives, the more we become

110
00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:38.800
like him.

111
00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:42.380
Deeper levels of holiness are needed

112
00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:46.960
and possible, and that's the first lesson of Exodus and Leviticus.

113
00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.220
Let's keep going deeper.

114
00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.740
Never stop. That's what God's got for you next.

115
00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.100
Deeper levels of holiness. They're needed, and they're possible.

116
00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.640
They are possible.

117
